{"id":112,"verses":[{"index":1,"arabic":"قُلۡ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","english":"Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One"},{"index":2,"arabic":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","english":"Allah, the Eternal Refuge"},{"index":3,"arabic":"لَمۡ يَلِدۡ وَلَمۡ يُولَدۡ","english":"He neither begets nor is born"},{"index":4,"arabic":"وَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدُۢ","english":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent"}]}